      en: ["Capital of Cantagalo District with a population of approximately 10,000.", "Positioned on the eastern coast along the main EN2 highway.", "Home to the nearby Boca do Inferno, a significant volcanic coastal site.", "Economic base includes both industrial and artisanal fishing activities.", "Proximity to Roça Água Izé links it to the island's cocoa history.", "Serves as a primary transit and trade hub for southern São Tomé."],
