      en: ["Formerly one of the most prestigious Roças (plantations) on the island.", "Situated in the inland hills of the Cantagalo District.", "Features well-preserved colonial infrastructure, including an old hospital.", "Current economy is driven by smallholder cocoa cooperatives.", "Surrounded by lush secondary forests and extensive palm groves.", "Located roughly 15 kilometers south of the national capital."],
