      en: "Ribeira Peixe is a lively community in the deep south that has developed around one of the country's busiest oil palm plantations. Here industrial dynamics and rural tradition meet. The village is surrounded by endless rows of palms stretching to the horizon, while residents use the rich soil to feed their families and preserve the secrets of the forest."
