      en: "Sundy is a place of science and stars nestled in the gentle plains of northern Príncipe. Here world history was written in 1919 when sunbeams during an eclipse confirmed Einstein's theories. Roça Sundy with its neoclassical manor house still breathes this spirit of discovery today while the palm avenues and nearby beach make the town a stage of timeless natural beauty."
